# ====================================================================
# .copilotignore Template
# To UNBLOCK a file/folder, just add a '#' to the beginning of its line
# ====================================================================

# Block massive compiled directories and build artifacts
**/target/
**/build/
**/.gradle/
**/node_modules/

# Block heavy raw data and logs that drain credits instantly
**/*.log
**/*.csv
**/*.json
**/*.xml

# Block heavy text/documentation folders
**/docs/
**/*.pdf
**/*.md

# Block specific heavy configuration or deployment directories
**/.docker/
**/kubernetes/
